    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton manager for the in-AR plane-detection toggle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks the user&apos;s plane-detection preference and disables the toggle automatically when 1:1 scale mode is active. Must be initialised by calling Initialize (done by MiscOptionsManager). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
